# Flask Chatbot

A simple AI-powered chatbot built with **Flask** and **OpenAI API**.  
The user can send a message through a web interface and get an AI-generated response.

## Features
- Flask backend
- Simple HTML/CSS frontend
- OpenAI API integration

## Installation
```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
export OPENAI_API_KEY="your_api_key_here"
python app.py

